# Regenerable Unreal Engine build artifacts — forward-only ignore.
#
# This file is INERT on already-tracked files: it does NOT un-track anything
# that is already committed. Its only effect is to stop NEW build artifacts
# from being staged, so real source/asset changes stop being buried in noise.
#
# Un-tracking the already-committed artifacts (git rm --cached) is a SEPARATE,
# explicitly-approved maintainer step — see the reproducibility decision sheet.
# Do NOT git clean / git checkout this tree: it carries load-bearing untracked
# state (e.g. Content/Maps/*.uasset deliverables, generated UHT for new tasks).

# UE-generated, rebuildable trees
Binaries/
Build/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/

# macOS / toolchain build droppings
*.app/
libtbb*.dylib

# Visual Studio project files (regenerated by UE from the .uproject)
.vs/
.vsconfig
*.sln
*.slnx

# Plugins/ holds a host-local clone of the private aura-plugin repo (Aura + Ramen).
# It is machine-local and must never be committed (the `cb doctor` plugins-cloned
# check verifies it; docs/WINDOWS.md §3 has the clone step).
Plugins/
